window.products.push({"id":383253,"name":"OAKSWARE Cutting Boards, Large Acacia Wooden Cutting Board for Kitchen, Edge Grain Reversible Wood Chopping Board with Juice Groove and Handles, Pre-O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rcjmONpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER IMPORTANT - Make sure you understand the size of this acacia wood cutting board before ordering. The size of this medium cutting board is 15 x 10 x 1 Inch. LONG LASTING DURABLE EDGE GRAIN ACACIA - Our Acacia Edge Grain Cutting Boards are built of durable solid construction, this construction type is known to be extremely durable, to withstand heavy-duty chopping, and is highly desired for its 'self-healing' properties. Each knife cut goes between the wood fibers, rather than cutting through them. Each cutting board you receive is unique that has unique natural color and pattern. LARGE SURFACE, REVERSIBLE, VERSATILE - Cut, chop, and dice on this large edge grain acacia wood cutting board for all your cutting needs. With a reversible design, you can place the acacia wood serving tray on a kitchen countertop or dining table to gather friends and family together around good food and conversation. DEEP JUICE GROOVE, BUILT-IN HANDLES - Say Goodbye to Mess countertop. Our chopping board features a dual-sided wood block, which keeps your counters and table nice and tidy. The deep juice groove along the whole wood board can capture excess liquid so there’s no mess in your counter space; the built-in side handles can be used as carving trays for meat, cheese, and bread. CARE FOR ACACIA WOODEN CUTTING BOARDS - Each wooden cutting board is coated with food-grade mineral oil that helps to stop splintering and bending. With proper care (hand washes only) and monthly oiling, it will preserve the rich color and longer-lasting use. PERFECT GIFT - This chopping board set arrives ready for use out of the box, and it can be a great gift idea for housewarming parties, weddings, anniversaries, holidays, or birthdays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rcjmONpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OAKSWARE","source_asin":"B09YNCXVDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YNCXVDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YNCXVDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
