window.products.push({"id":383380,"name":"RICOVERO Triple Layer Nonstick Ceramic Griddle Pan for Stove Top & Induction Cooktop with Stain Resistant Stone Finish – 11” Flat Pan - Oven & Dishwas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LrX7xxl9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The RICOVERO Triple Layer Nonstick Ceramic Griddle Pan is a versatile and durable cooking tool perfect for any kitchen. This 11-inch flat pan is designed to work seamlessly on all types of cooktops, including gas, electric, and induction. Whether you are whipping up pancakes, cooking eggs, grilling sandwiches or steaks, this griddle pan has got you covered! One of the key features of this griddle pan is its advanced three-layer nonstick ceramic coating. This coating ensures that food release is effortless, making it easier to cook without added oils or butter. It also prevents food from sticking to the pan, making cleaning up after cooking a breeze. In addition to its nonstick coating, this flat pan griddle is also designed with durability in mind. The 3 mm thick pressed aluminum construction helps distribute heat evenly across the surface, preventing hotspots and ensuring consistent temperature control. This added thickness also increases the durability of the pan, making it able to withstand wear and tear over time. The stone finish of this flat pan is not only functional but also adds a natural aesthetic touch to your kitchen. Its timeless design will preserve its sleek appearance and cooking performance for years to come. The stone finish also enhances durability, making it resistant to stains and scratches. Another great feature of this stovetop grill is that it is 100% free of harmful chemicals such as lead, PFOA, and cadmium. This ensures that the food you cook is safe and healthy. The griddle pan is also oven safe, allowing you to finish off dishes in the oven or keep them warm before serving. Plus, it is dishwasher safe! The RICOVERO Griddle Pan is an excellent investment for any home cook. Its nonstick surface, even heat distribution, and durability makes it an ideal tool for cooking a wide range of dishes. Its universal compatibility with all cooktops, natural stone finish, and safe and healthy cooking properties makes it a must-have for any home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LrX7xxl9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RICOVERO","source_asin":"B0BY9S3RF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY9S3RF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY9S3RF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
