window.products.push({"id":383457,"name":"Molblly Folding Mattress,4.5 Inch Portable Tri Fold Full Mattress Topper,Folding Memory Foam Mattress Pad Sofa Bed,Fold Up Bed,Camping Padded,Play Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812JSflwjdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Comfortable Structure】 MOLBLLY 4.5inch folding mattress adopts a double-layer design: (1) 1” gel memory foam, which fits the body perfectly and absorbs 95% of body pressure; (2) 5” high-density support foam, from head to toe Provide perfect and stable support for the body, create a moderate firmness, and enjoy a painless sleep. 【Convenience at Home】MOLBLLY foldable folding mattress can be adjusted to two different positions. Lying in one posture, sitting in another posture. You can adjust the position at will. This folding mattress sofa can be not only a mattress, but also a sofa. To meet your different needs, this multi-functional three-fold mattress will be an ideal solution for small houses with limited space. 【Portable Multi-Function Mattress】 MOLBLLY tri-folding mattress is easy to fold and unfold, which is a good substitute for air mattress. Ideal for your guests, playing games with kids, traveling, camping, yoga in any room, mobile home, tent or car. 【Comfortable and urable】 The cooling-gel memory foam keeps you cool and reduce your body pressure all night, and the medium firm feel offers additional comfort and ergonomic support. The high-quality materials and high density foams guarantee its service life. 【Safe and Worry-Free】MOLBLLY tri-folding pad meets product standards: CertiPUR US and OEKO-TEX 100, which means it does not contain unhealthy chemicals such as formaldehyde, mercury and other heavy metals. We offer an honest 10-year limited warranty and a 30-day refund policy. Please allow 72 hours for the mattress to fully expand. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to reach out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812JSflwjdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molblly","source_asin":"B092VCL9MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VCL9MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VCL9MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
