window.products.push({"id":383509,"name":"White 28 Inch Tall Floor Vase Extra Large Decorative Ceramic Flower Vase, Stable Bottom Wide Vase Mouth, for Dried Flower Arrangement, Living Room Déc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aeWLz1eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【HIGH-QUALITY CERAMIC MATERIAL】Made of premium100% ceramic, kiln-fired at 1300 degrees high temperature for extra strength. Durable and crack resistant for extended life. Smooth surface with flat and unglazed bottom for stability. The interior is also glazed, so it can be used to hold water for fresh flowers. ✅【UNIQUE DESIGN IN PORCELAIN WHITE】This simple but elegant home decoration vase has a bright glaze with a delicate and smooth surface. The conical-shaped texture design combines artistry and practicality. After the repeated glazing process, the surface of the vase is very smooth and round. ✅【28\" TALL FLOOR VASE 】The overall size of this vase is 71(H)×19(D)cm/28\"×7.5\". The diameter at the widest point of the bottle mouth is about 13cm/5.1\". The ceramic vase is placed in a fully wrapped thick plastic foam and shockproof cardboard box packaging to avoid damage during transportation. Thank you for your understanding and support! ✅【UNIVERSAL HOME DECORATION】Simple and beautiful white vases are suitable for decoration of various scenes, such as living room, office, hallway, dining room, parties, or other sweet occasions. Place the vase on a suitable tabletop or shelf for flower arrangements, fresh flower bouquets, and dried flowers to refresh your home decor year after year. ✅【BEAUTIFUL AND ELEGANT GIFTS】Perfect gift for your lover, parents, relatives, friends, or those who love to decorate their home, and bring joy and good memories to everyone. As a gift for housewarmings, weddings, holidays or Christmas, Thanksgiving, New Year, etc. Will add a touch of romance and warmth to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aeWLz1eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KSYGINXD","source_asin":"B082KJ8JNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082KJ8JNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082KJ8JNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":383510,"name":"Homykic Bamboo Bathroom Storage Shelf, 7-Tier Detachable Narrow Shelf Freestanding Towel Rack Wood Corner Stand Organizer for Corner, Bathroom, Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BvRsbKTaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE SAVING BATHROOM STORAGE - Bathroom may be a tricky space to organize, it is short on square footage but has plenty that needs to be tucked away. We recommend using this standing shelf that combines space-saving and extra storage to make full use of the vertical space. That is a great way to help take some of the load off your vanity storage. It is sturdy and will not rust like a metal rack. DETACHABLE STORAGE SHELF - Bamboo corner shelf brings some much-need storage space to your bathroom. It has a 63\" tall frame with 7 open slatted shelves that are perfect for storing toilet paper, towels, hairdryer, makeup, soaps, shampoo, and other bathroom toiletries without catching water. This bathroom shelf stand is detachable, can be slipped into the low narrow nook in your bathroom. MULTIPURPOSE SHELVING UNIT - Useful in more than just your bathroom, measures 14.17'' W x 11.14'' D x 62.99\" H, load capacity of the lower half is: 33 lbs per layer, the upper part is: 22 lbs per layer. Can be a bookshelf to display books, potted plants, photo frames, and art collections in the living room, be a storage rack to organize the spices and dishes in the kitchen. Slim figure to stand in any suitable place in your house. WE CARE ABOUT SUSTAINABILITY - Crafted from sustainable bamboo, the fast-growing bamboo is a better choice for furniture. White and natural colors match your classic or rustic style decor, come with anti-tilt kits for added safety. VERY EASY TO ASSEMBLE - The assembly is easy with the provided step-by-step instructions and hardware pack. Only one kind of screw is needed, absolutely no confusion. Wipe clean with a clean damped cloth. Avoid using harsh chemicals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BvRsbKTaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homykic","source_asin":"B09QSQH498","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QSQH498","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QSQH498","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
