window.products.push({"id":383529,"name":"Home Soft Things Microfiber Pleated Bedskirt, Stylish Design Wrap Around Solid Microfiber with 18\" Drop, Gathered Ruffled Bedding Home Decoration, Que","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o2NsYt6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEDSPREAD IN IMAGES SOLD SEPARATELY. Simple and elegant, the pleated bed skirt collection is exactly what every bed needs to add the beauty a bedspread deserves. Made of high-end microfiber polyester this is one of Serenta's highest quality bed skirts to date. Not only does it keep the dust from entering underneath a bed but also accents a bedspread with 6 lively colors and a vivacious style. Easy to put on a bed and has an eighteen-inch reach from the top of the box spring to the floor. ALL SEASONS VERSATILE USAGE! 100% Polyester. COMFORT MADE WITH STYLE! 30 Design Variations: Beige, Burgundy, Burnt Orange, Carmine, Chocolate, Coffee Bean, Dusk, Epsom, Gold, Harbor Grey, Incense, Leaf Green, Light Brown, Majesty, Marzipan, Misty Rose, Nomad, Pagoda Blue, Pink, Silver Blue, Spring Crocus, Tannin, Taupe, Tea Rose, Light Blue, Ivory, Melody Grey, Mystic Grey, White, and Erget. JUST THE RIGHT SIZE! Available in 3 sizes. - King Size Contains: 1pc Bed Skirt 78\" x 80\" + 18\"; - Queen Size Contains: 1pc Bed Skirt 60\" x 80\" + 18\"; - Twin Size Contains: 1pc Bed Skirt 39\" x 75\" + 18\". EASY AT HOME CARE! Machine wash, separately, using cold water. Tumble dry on lowest heat setting to avoid heat damage. Your bed skirt can lose its softness and texture if washed in hot water or dried using high temperatures. When properly cared for, you can enjoy your bedspread for a lifetime and expect the color to last due to in-house pre-treatment. Serenta BRAND BRILLIANCE! 100% Polyester fabric is non-shedding, snuggly, and high-quality crafted. In-house manufacturing allows us to cut the middleman and provide you with high-end products at affordable prices. You will distinguish the difference in Serenta products to others as soon as you sink your hands into the high-grade fibers, designs, and construction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o2NsYt6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B07NQD5DP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NQD5DP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NQD5DP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
