window.products.push({"id":383621,"name":"BrylaneHome Virginia Bedspread - Queen, Multi Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":135.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A13mbDMW+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Includes 1 Bedspread. Purchase Matching Shams Separately. A traditional patchwork design gives your room enduring style. The floral medallion print in the center, floral printed border and scalloped bedspread edges are details you'll love. Features a solid reverse. Twin: 80\" X 110\", Full: 96\" X 110\", Queen: 102\" X 118\", King: 120\" X 118\" King: 120\" X 118\". Cotton Front; Polyester Back & Fill. Machine Wash. Imported. ABOUT THE BRAND: Making Homes Beautiful. Since 1998, BrylaneHome has been dedicated to offering colorful comfort, classic design with a twist and outstanding value—so you can furnish your home with unique personal style. From easy updates to classic pieces to invest in, we provide solutions for every room. We strive to help you create a home you love to live in, at a price you can live with. BrylaneHome—Be Colorful. Be Comfortable. Be Home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A13mbDMW+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrylaneHome","source_asin":"B07TVVT8CR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TVVT8CR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TVVT8CR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":383622,"name":"Pioneer Photo Albums BSP-46 Navy Blue Photo Album","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811QWS8GXcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This leatherette photo album features gold accents on the cover. The album holds 204 4\"x6\" prints and is post bound allowing for the addition of unlimited refills. Photos are displayed 6 per page in optically clear pockets with a black mesh background. The album measures 14.25\"x13.75\"x1.25\". Uses refill BSP. Photo safe: Acid, lignin and PVC free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811QWS8GXcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pioneer Photo Albums","source_asin":"B003WSQZMO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WSQZMO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WSQZMO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":383623,"name":"CYMULA Knit Throw Blanket for Couch Navy Blue-Super Soft Lightweight Plush Fuzzy Fluffy Cozy Blankets and Throws for Sofa Bed, 50x60 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wNs0qjkZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Soft and Cozy: Our blanket is made of 100% premium microfiber polyester, giving you a creamy, silky feeling. It has a high quality durable construction, sewn step by step by precision machines with strong seams around the edges. It is very soft, comfortable, delicate and smooth, but light weight and not too hot. It has a wonderful ultra-soft texture that is perfect for snuggling up in. Multi Purpose:This is a soft personal blanket that can be hung on a chair or sofa, placed at the foot of a bed, used on a porch swing bed, or anywhere you want to curl up in a blanket. Imagine yourself covered in this cloud-like soft blanket and you will have a sweet dream. It's also a great choice if you give it as a gift to someone, no one will refuse such a lovely blanket. You can also use it to decorate your sofa to prevent it from getting dirty, use it to cover your pet and it will feel your love. Premium Quality and Durable: We have a strong factory supply chain, first-class manufacturing technology, and strict control from raw material procurement to every production step. The fabric is stretchy, and after machine washing, the blanket still keeps its shape and looks like new! It is wrinkle, fade and crease resistant and softer to the skin than ordinary blankets, so you can use it with confidence. Easy Care: Machine washable on gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat. Best to wash alone, avoid direct heat and bleach. Care Tips: The blanket is packed by vacuum compression! After unpacking, please leave it for a while to let the blanket regain its softness. If you wash it in the washing machine and then air dry, the softness will return to its original state. Worry-Free After-sales Service: Customer satisfaction is our eternal pursuit. Our blankets are currently available in 50X60 inch and 60X80 inch sizes for you to choose from. Please make sure the size is suitable when you purchase, if you are not satisfied with the quality of the blanket, please feel free to contact us within 30 days, we will give you a full refund unconditionally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wNs0qjkZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYMULA","source_asin":"B0BLRQ65LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLRQ65LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLRQ65LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":383624,"name":"Yatsen Bridge 5 Piece Sunrise Seaview Canvas Painting Large Print Art for Living Room Wall Art Home Decoration Office Decor Ready to Hang 60''W x 32''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YFgmvDD4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Introduction: 1.High definition picture photo prints on canvas with vivid color on thick high quality canvas to create the look and feel of the original nature and masterpiece. 2.This art work comes already perfectly stretched on wooden frame with hooks mounted on each panel for easy hanging out of box. 3.The side margins are also printed to create a particularly decorative effect.  4.Canvas Wall Art and Canvas paintings are the modern way to brighten the walls of your home, and relax you after work. It is sure to captivate wherever it is hung. 5.A perfect Christmas and New Year ,wedding, anniversary, thanksgiving, christmas, mother's Day, father's Day, valentine, birthday gifts for your relatives and friends. VERY IMPORTANT FOR SIZE: 1.Please note display pictures are only for illustration purposes. 2.They were not taken in real display rooms and do not represent the real size of the print set. 3.They are just as an idea to help you being aware of how this canvas art print looks like in your room. 4.Please measure the wall accurately and make sure to choose the right size. Item Specifics: Material: Wood and Canvas Type: Giclee Printed Application: Living Room, Bedroom, Kitchen, Bathroom, Dinning Room, Guest Room, Office, Hotel, Cafe, Restaurant, Bar and Hall Canvas Purpose: The oil paintings on canvas are exceptionally durable and can be cleaned with a dry,soft. This is an elegant decorative way to highlight your unique artsy taste. Stunning home decorations that earning compliments from your guests. Contemporary wall paintings for any space to remove boring blank. Bring in a dream world that relaxing and inspiring our family everyday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YFgmvDD4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yatsen Bridge","source_asin":"B097R5ZZD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097R5ZZD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097R5ZZD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
