window.products.push({"id":383631,"name":"Polar Rox Silicone Ice Cube Trays (2-Piece Set) Easy Release Large Square Molds | BPA Free, Reusable, Flexible | Whiskey, Scotch, Cocktail, Beverages ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U2dQQWCDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience Polar Rox silicone ice molds and enjoy your favorite beverages with a single block of perfectly-sized ice in every glass. Whether you want a refreshing glass of water on a hot summer’s day or you want to make the perfect cocktail on the rocks, nothing gives you colder, more refreshing than a large, square ice cube created in a Polar Rox Silicone Ice Trays . They’re perfectly sized to help maintain your drink’s temperature without watering it down. Easy to Fill, Non-Spill Design Better than the old, stiff plastic ice cube trays of the past, these flexible silicone ice molds are tough, durable and easy to use. In fact, the non-stick surface makes it easy to “pop out” your ice cube in a perfect shape. Great for kids and adult beverages alike, use it to keep your drinks cool, for making candy or chocolate treats, or even baby food. And because can be used in the microwave, oven or freezer, there’s no end to their versatile uses. Product Details: Two (2) Silicone Ice Cube Trays Two (2) Silicone Ice Cube Trays Flexible, Durable and Heat Resistant (-40 ˚F to 410 ˚F) Flexible, Durable and Heat Resistant (-40 ˚F to 410 ˚F) BPA Free and Food Grade Safe BPA Free and Food Grade Safe Dishwasher, Freezer and Oven Safe Dishwasher, Freezer and Oven Safe Easy to Clean Easy to Clean Stain and Odor Resistant Stain and Odor Resistant Click ‘Add to Cart’ now to get these premium silicone ice cube trays and always enjoy a delicious, fresh beverage that isn’t watered down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U2dQQWCDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polar Rox","source_asin":"B072MQ75P9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072MQ75P9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072MQ75P9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":383632,"name":"Supplying Demand WB27X11099 1556172 Microwave Fuse Replacement Model Specific Not Universal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718IzBCCQjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please see Model Number fitment information at the bottom of this page before placing your order for this part. Alternate part numbers include AP4484364, AH2370189, EA2370189, and PS2370189. If your microwave is continually blowing fuses you may need to check the door switch for continuity. This fuse will not blow unless it goes above a 20 amp pull. If this happens then you need to find out where the short is before replacing fuses as they will constantly blow if the short is not fixed. It is important to disconnect your appliance from the power supply before servicing. Service Tip: Microwaves hold electric energy in the capacitor even AFTER they are unplugged. Be careful in making sure that all electricity has been safely discharged in the microwave before attempting a repair. Supplying Demand replacement parts are compatible with Major Brands, but you should always verify fitment with your specific model. We have included a video in the product gallery to help you find your model number and information in the description below. SD products come in Supplying Demand packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718IzBCCQjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplying Demand","source_asin":"B082B8WT62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082B8WT62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082B8WT62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
