window.products.push({"id":383732,"name":"Good Karma Studio 240 Pantry Labels + 15 Blank Labels for Plastic Containers and Glass Containers in Calligraphy Font, Clear, Water-Resistant Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9137Iw8rFAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your kitchen SPARKLE with our charming Calligraphy Font pantry labels for organizing. This set is the PERFECT comprehensive size set of 240 clear pantry labels for the contemporary American household. In addition, you will receive a sheet of 15 clear, blank labels in case there is anything you want to add. This is an up-to-date set of the most commonly used pantry items from trail mixes and cereals to your full range of grains and pastas to coffee and teas. Each set of kitchen labels for canisters includes the following:- 17 8 ½ x 11 inch sheets of easy to find canister decals organized by category.- 240 large 2 x 2 to 2 x 4 inch, easy to read canister labels.- A sheet of 15 blank organizing labels for adding any additional items.- These canister stickers are clear, glossy, high-quality PVC labels. They are water-resistant and are designed for use on both glass and plastic.Not only will you create a picture perfect experience, but organizing your pantry can make for a great money saving and environmentally friendly solution as well. As you clear away the clutter in your pantry and have easy access to what you value, wasting time and money can go down in a big way!We have carefully surveyed and researched the United States pantry label audience to put together a thorough set of the most commonly used household items. Each sheet of canister set labels is organized by category to make finding the right label easy to do. We will also provide you an alphabetical list of labels. These delightful kitchen canister decals are put together with feedback from YOU and are continually updated to ensure they suit the full range of needs of YOUR household. Good Karma Studio seeks to create uniquely designed and functional pieces for the contemporary home. We pride ourselves in our modern and whimsical designs and are always researching the US market. Thank you for considering Good Karma Studio for your kitchen needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9137Iw8rFAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Karma Studio","source_asin":"B082MQRP4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082MQRP4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082MQRP4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
