window.products.push({"id":383931,"name":"Home4me Electric Fireplace 42 inch, Recessed and Wall Mounted 750/1500W Fireplace Heater and Freestanding Linear Fireplace, Remote Control with Timer,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jhC++5IgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Attractive and Practical Design】: Home4me electric fireplace size: 42\"Lx 17.01\"Hx4.13\"W. The realistic flame effect combined and modern texture crystal creates a comfortable and warm atmosphere for your home. The electric fireplace can provide warmth for you and your family in many scenes, such as gathering, writing, sleeping, working, reading, etc. Even in not cold seasons, you can also use this led fireplace to decorate your home. Notice: To remove the glass screen, you need to remove the four silver screws on both sides, and then lift the glass screen up to easily remove it (The glass screen has a snap design, which must be lifted upwards to remove it!). 【Realistic Flame Effect】: Home4me wall mounted electric fireplace offers 12 LED flame bed color modes, the full spectrum and high-intensity LED colors reflect onto the crystal, creating incredibly realistic and colorful effects. If you prefer the vintage wood burning flame effect, you can also replace the crystals with the log set that we provide. In addition, our electric fireplace also provides 5 levels of flame intensity adjustment, you can freely adjust the brightness of the flame. 【Multiple Installation Modes】This electric fireplace inserts not only can be recessed in the wall but also can be wall mounted and can freestanding. You can mount the two matching free-standing legs on the electric fireplace bottom so that you can place it where you want and just plug directly into the 110-120V voltage can safely use the fireplace. You can also use your creativity to create a backdrop wall for the electric fireplace so that you can insert or mount the fireplace on the wall. 【Safe and Energy Saving】: This fireplace heater use LED technology instead of combustible materials, saving time and energy as this fireplace produces no messy、harmful gases and harmful things, safe for your family and pets. And the wall mounted fireplace is CSA certificated and equipped with a safety cut-off device for overheating protection to avoid safety problems caused by overheating. Enables heating while still maintaining the natural humidity in the air and not over-drying the room. 【Efficient Two Heat Settings】Two heat settings (high 1500W and low 750W) can be adjusted accordingly for both warm and energy-saving purposes. The supplemental zone heating is for up to 400 square feet. The thermostat can control the room temperature from 62℉ to 82℉ to suit the user's preference. The countdown timer can be set to turn off the fireplace for up to 8 hours. Customer service is always ready to help whenever you have questions about this electric fireplace.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jhC++5IgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home4me","source_asin":"B0BLJJ15FQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLJJ15FQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLJJ15FQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
