window.products.push({"id":383983,"name":"TAILI Soap Holder Suction Cup NO-Drilling Removable Suction Cup Soap Dish Wall Mounted Powerful Heavy Duty Max Hold 11lbs Sponge Holder Waterproof Hol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vBzIznrnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PATENTED PRODUCT - Super Durable & Powerful EASY TO CLEAN The soap dish is removable. When it need to be cleaned, you can take it out and wash it easily. Water Resistance & Oil Resistance Waterproof & Oilproof design makes the soap holder suction cup can be used in wet areas such as bathrooms and kitchens. REUSABLE Simply use the credit card to remove the hook from the wall, and then just wash the suction cup with warm water and air dry it for re-install. DAMAGE-FREE No drilling, No screws, No holes, No glue, No tools to apply the vacuum suction cup. Multifunctional √ For bathroom √ For kitchen Instructions for Installation: 1. Clean and dry the installation area.  2. Peel off the protective film on the hook. Please, take it off carefully!  3. Press the hook on the \"PUSH\" logo with your palm until see an obvious distance change between the suction pad and the applying surface or hearing a weak sound of \"puff\". And check the hook by pulling the hook down. If the hook can not be moved by hand which means the installation is right or you need to press it with more strength How to remove: 1. Please use a credit card to remove and wash it with warm water before re-installation. 2. To prevent hurting your hand, do not remove it directly, because the suction power is very strong.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vBzIznrnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAILI","source_asin":"B07MTV8FG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-383983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MTV8FG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MTV8FG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
